# Atlas Core - Low-Latency Onboarding Flow Architecture Spec
**Author:** Byte Cross  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D16 18:25  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Engineered UX/UI design specification and interaction model for the Atlas Core onboarding flow rework. Reduces user drop-off via optimistic UI state transitions, sub-150ms screen loads, and inline face-to-face service routing, referencing requirements from Company Document.

